<Plugin>
  <Name>UGREEN DXP4800 Pro LEDs</Name>
  <Overview>Controls the Power, LAN and four drive-bay LEDs on the UGREEN DXP4800 Pro. Configurable colours, disk activity pulses and standby breathing. Requires Unraid 7.3+ and exact kernel 6.18.38-Unraid. Confirm physical bay mapping before enabling disk LEDs. Remove competing LED plugins before installation.</Overview>
